==English==

===Etymology===
{{bor+|en|frm|varieux}}, from {{der|en|la|varius||[[manifold]], diverse, various, parti-colored, variegated, also changing, changeable, fickle, etc.}}. {{surf|en|vary|-ous}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|en|/ˈvɛəɹi.əs/|a=RP}}
* {{IPA|en|/ˈvɛəɹi.əs/|/ˈvæɹi.əs/|a2=among some speakers|a=GA,non-Mary-marry-merry}}
** {{audio|en|en-us-ne-various.ogg|a=US,non-Mary-marry-merry|IPA=/ˈvɛəɹi.əs/}}
** {{audio|en|en-us-ne-1-various.ogg|a=US,non-Mary-marry-merry|IPA=/ˈvæɹi.əs/}}
* {{IPA|en|/ˈvɛɹi.əs/|a=GA,Mary-marry-merry}}
** {{audio|en|en-us-various.ogg|a=US,Mary-marry-merry}}
* {{rhymes|en|ɛəɹi.əs|æɹi.əs|s=3}}

===Determiner===
{{en-head|det}}

# {{senseid|en|determiner}} More than one (of an indeterminate set of things).
#: {{ux|en|'''Various''' books have been taken.}}
#: {{ux|en|There are '''various''' ways to fix the problem.}}
#: {{ux|en|You have broken '''various''' of the rules.}}

===Adjective===
{{en-adj|-}}

# Having a broad range (of [[different]] elements).
#: {{ux|en|The reasons are '''various'''.}}
#* {{RQ:Orczy Miss Elliott|chapter=The Affair at the Novelty Theatre|passage=For this scene, a large number of supers are engaged, and in order to further swell the crowd, practically all the available stage hands have to ‘walk on’ dressed in '''various''' coloured dominoes, and all wearing masks.}}
#* {{quote-book|en|year=1922|title=Zoroastrian Civilization|author=Maneckji Nusservanji Dhalla|url=https://archive.org/details/in.ernet.dli.2015.41950|page=114|passage=The penalty for the breach of '''various''' contracts is scourging with stripes{{...}}}}
# {{lb|en|dated}} That varies or differs from others; [[variant]]; [[different]], [[sundry]].
#: {{ux|en|a '''various''' reading of a Biblical text}}

